:: Temple Bunk
<<set $location to "temple">>
<<bedclotheson "Temple Bunk Bed">>
<<effects>>

당신은 신전 숙소에 있는 당신의 침상 옆에 있다. 옷을 넣을 찬장과, 갈아입을 수 있도록 가림막 뒤에 마련된 작은 공간이 있다.
<br><br>

<<if Time.dayState is "night">>
	침상은 모두 차 있고, 방 안은 이따금 들리는 코골이를 제외하면 조용하다.
<<elseif Time.dayState is "day">>
	수련생들이 먼지를 털고 청소하느라 여념이 없다.
<<elseif Time.dayState is "dawn">>
	수도사와 수녀들은 이미 일어나 활동하고 있다.
<<elseif Time.dayState is "dusk">>
	몇몇 수도사와 수녀들이 잠자리에 들 준비를 하고 있다.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<if $unbind is 1>>
	<<unset $unbind>>
	<<if $possessed>>
		당신은 당신의 결박을 내려다본다. 당신이 당기자, 그것들은 당신을 버티지 못하고 부서져 버린다.
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		<span class="green">당신은 묶인 부위를 탁자 모서리에 문지른다.</span> 힘은 좀 들지만, 결국 소재가 버티지 못하고 풀려 팔다리가 자유로워진다.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
	<<unbind>>
<</if>>

<<if pcAreArmsBound("any") or $feetuse is "bound">>
	<<undobindingsicon>><<link [[구속을 푼다 (0:10)|Temple Bunk]]>><<set $unbind to 1>><<pass 10>><</link>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<if $earSlime.event and $earSlime.noSleep>>
	<<if $possessed>>
		<<ind>><span class="purple">머릿속의 슬라임은 조용하다.</span>
	<<else>>
		<<ind>><span class="red">머릿속의 슬라임은 잠자리에 들기 전에 당신이 <<print $earSlime.event>>하길 원한다.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	<<bedicon>><<link [[벗고 침대에 들어간다|Temple Bunk Bed]]>><<undressSleep "Temple Bunk Bed">><</link>>
	<br>
	<<listsleepoutfits "Temple Bunk Bed">>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<roomoptions>>
<<safehouseEvents>>
<<wardrobeicon>><<link [[옷장|Temple Wardrobe]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<icon "mirror.png">><<link [[거울|Temple Mirror]]>><<preMirror>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[뒤로 물러난다|Temple Quarters]]>><</link>>

<br><br>
<<link [[게임플레이 설정|Temple Settings]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<attitudesControlCheck>>
<<if $attitudesControl.showGoldLink is true>>
	<span class="goldLink"><<link [[태도|Attitudes]]>><<set $attitudesExitPassage to $passage>><</link>> </span><span class="red">!!</span>
<<else>>
	<<link [[태도|Attitudes]]>><<set $attitudesExitPassage to $passage>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>

:: Temple Settings [exitCheckBypass]
<<effects>>

<<set $settingsExitPassage to "Temple Bunk">>
<<settings>>

:: Temple Mirror
<<effects>>
<<getouticon>><<link [[물러난다|Temple Bunk]]>><<unset $mirrorMenu>><<unset $bodywritingSet>><</link>>
<br>
<<mirror "비친 인영">>
<br><br>

:: Temple Bunk Bed
<<set $location to "temple">>
<<effects>>
<<wearoutfit>>

<<if numberOfEarSlime() and $location is "temple" and random(0,100) lt 3 + Math.floor($earSlime.growth / 100) - $earSlime.eventTimer and !$earSlime.event>>
	<<set $slimeBedExit to "Temple Bunk Bed">>
	<<set $slimeBedroomExit to "Temple Bunk">>
	<<setSlimeSleepEvents>>
	<<if $earSlimeEvent>>
		<<slimeSleepEvents>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<<nightmareCheck "Temple Sleep">>
<<generateSleepLinks "Temple Sleep">>
<<link [[침대에서 나온다|Temple Bunk]]>><<storeon "Temple Bunk Bed">><<set $wardrobe_location to "temple">><<loadTempHairStyle>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: Temple Sleep
<<set _autosavehere to true>>
<<sleep>>
<<if _dreaming>>
	/* <<earSlimeFocusChoice>> or similar widgets are running */
<<else>>
	<<effects>>
	<<wakingEffects $sleepHoursTotal>>
	<<if $nightmares gte 1 and $controlled is 0>>
		<<nightmareWake>>
	<<else>>
		<<if ($specialClothesEffects.bimbo.total gte random(100,1000) || $specialClothesEffects.pimp.total gte random(100,1000)) or $arousal gte ($arousalmax / 10) * 9>>
			<<wetDream>>
		<<elseif !_wakingEffect>>
			당신은 깊이 잠든다.
			<br><br>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<sleepeffects>>

	<<set $wardrobe_location to "temple">>
	<<wardrobeSelection true>>
	<<radiooutfits>>

	<br><br>
	<<link [[일어난다|Temple Bunk]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<set $phase to 0>>
<</if>>
